  <TargetFramework>net10.0-windows10.0.19041.0</TargetFramework><OutputType>WinExe</OutputType><UseWPF>true</UseWPF><UseWindowsForms>true</UseWindowsForms><PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
